   "body": "the organism is named (fruit fly) and placed as Drosophila melanogaster, and the REQUIREMENT is not read at all: 0 criteria. \"Lives longer\" is not in the spec vocabulary, so the clause stays unparsed. That is correct behaviour and it is the whole finding: there is no scenario, no metric and no threshold anywhere in this engine for how long an organism lives.",
