   "author": "agent:long-lived-fly",
   "body": "generation 2: The fly walks and flies. Ask the locomotion layer both, partly to exercise it on an insect and partly because the flight branch should refuse: the only lift coefficients in this repository are a flying fish and a sugar glider, and an insect is neither.",
   "lawset_version": "1.8.1"
  },
  {
   "seq": 8,
   "type": "finding",
   "ts": "2026-11-03T06:32:31.012Z",
   "author": "agent:long-lived-fly",
   "body": "nothing this layer can check contradicts the design. That is NOT a finding that it moves: there is no muscle here, no metabolism, no control and no energy budget, and 2 of the 4 checks are regime indicators that never fail anything.",
   "lawset_version": "1.8.1",
   "tool": "locomotion_check (walk)",
   "verdict": "not-contradicted",
   "generation": 2,
   "detail": {
    "reynolds": {
